[00:13.22]What love Jehovah showed,
[00:17.96]What goodness from him flowed,
[00:19.44]When for all mankind he offered his Firstborn.
[00:21.68]Christ took on human form—
[00:22.92]The Son of man was born—
[00:23.98]By his example, God’s name he adorned.
[00:27.60]Jehovah’s Word, he said,
[01:20.25]Sustained his life like bread.
[01:24.37]It gave him wisdom and knowledge and insight.
[01:32.61]His Father’s willing slave,
[01:36.38]A model Jesus gave;
[01:40.28]To please his Father would bring him delight.
[02:44.52]Like Jesus, may our days
[02:45.86]Provide Jehovah praise,
[02:47.36]And may his footsteps become our own roadway.
[02:49.22]Let Jesus’ model be
[03:13.58]Our path eternally,
[03:39.57]And then God’s favor we’ll know day by day.
